{"meta":{"id":"promise-all","category":"it/syntax/typescript/network","title":"Promise.all (병렬 처리) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"여러 API 병렬 처리 — 하나라도 실패하면 전체 거부, 이미 진행된 insert 는 롤백 안 됨","tags":["typescript","f-network","f-async"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">Promise.all (병렬 처리) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 여러 API 병렬 처리 — 하나라도 실패하면 전체 거부, 이미 진행된 insert 는 롤백 안 됨</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Promise.all — 여러 API 병렬 처리</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const [user, orders, notices] = await Promise.all([\r\n  getUser(1),\r\n  getOrders(1),\r\n  getNotices(),\r\n]);\r\n// 결과 타입: [User, Order[], Notice[]]  (순서 유지)</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">요청을 동시에 보내고 <strong>모두 끝나면</strong> 결과 배열을 받는다. 걸리는 시간 = 가장 느린 요청</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">하나라도 실패하면 전체 거부</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">try {\r\n  await Promise.all([insertA(), insertB(), insertC()]);\r\n} catch (e) {\r\n  // insertB 가 실패해도 insertA, insertC 요청은 이미 서버로 나가서 처리됐을 수 있음\r\n}</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">첫 번째 실패 시점에 바로 reject — 나머지 결과는 받을 수 없음</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-orange-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong>주의:</strong> 쿼리 insert 는 이미 진행된 상태이므로 롤백되지 않는다. 묶어서 성공/실패가 필요하면 서버에서 트랜잭션으로 한 번에 처리</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">관련 메서드</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">메서드</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">동작</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Promise.all</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">모두 성공해야 성공, 하나라도 실패하면 즉시 실패</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Promise.allSettled</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">성공/실패와 관계없이 모두 끝날 때까지 기다리고 각 결과 상태를 반환</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Promise.race</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">가장 먼저 끝난(성공 또는 실패) 결과 하나</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Promise.any</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">가장 먼저 성공한 결과 하나 (모두 실패 시 실패)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network/promise-all","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"network","title":"통신","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network"}],"hasImage":false}